# Nothing produced by the transcription harness belongs in git.
# Keep venv / weights / audio / transcripts in a scratch dir outside the repo;
# this is only a second line of defence if you run things in place.
venv/
.venv/
models/
audio/
results/
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
# Transcripts are the thing most likely to get dumped here by accident, and a
# committed one is ~400 KB of text the pipeline is supposed to discard. Blanket
# *.json is deliberate: add an explicit `!` exception if this directory ever
# needs a committed JSON file. `package.json` is pre-excepted because the CI
# suite runner (tools/ci/run-suites.mjs) treats a directory with one as a
# package to install and run -- silently ignoring it would silently drop this
# directory's tests.
*.json
!package.json
